Note on underlying market data: the price and interest-rate series in real_data/ are
redistributed here as reported by their original public sources (Yahoo Finance, the
Bank of Taiwan, the FDIC/FRED, and the Reserve Bank of Australia via DBnomics; see
README.md for details). This CC BY 4.0 license applies to the compiled dataset and
all code in this repository; users relying on the underlying data for purposes beyond
academic replication should also consult the original sources' own terms of use.
